sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant EmailProcessor as Email Processing
    participant Classifier as Ai Classification
    participant Router as Routing
    participant Agent as Product Agent
    participant KnowledgeBase as Knowledge Base (RAG)
    participant AiAssistant as Ai Assistant
    participant Approver as Approval Queue
    participant Responder as Response System

    Note over Customer,Responder: Email Processing (Product Agent)

    Customer->>EmailProcessor: Send Email (Product Inquiry)
    EmailProcessor->>EmailProcessor: Receive via Gmail Push Notification
    EmailProcessor->>Classifier: Extract & Normalize Content
    Classifier->>Classifier: Run GPT-4o Classification (product + Confidence)
    Classifier->>Classifier: Run Amazon Comprehend Sentiment Analysis
    Classifier->>Router: Classified Email (e.g., product)
    Router->>Agent: Route to Product Agent (if confidence >=60%)
    alt Confidence <60% or Escalation Needed
        Router->>AiAssistant: Escalate to AiAssistant
    end
    Agent->>KnowledgeBase: Vector Similarity Search (OpenAI Embeddings, Threshold 0.70)
    KnowledgeBase->>Agent: Retrieve Relevant Chunks (User-Isolated: Training URLs, Manual Content)
    alt No Relevant Data or Low Similarity
        Agent->>AiAssistant: Escalate to AiAssistant
        Agent->>Customer: Optional: "Don't have enough info" (but suggest escalate instead)
    else Relevant Data Found
        Agent->>Agent: Build Context from Chunks
        Agent->>Agent: Generate Response (Grounded, Source Attributed, Confidence-Based)
    end
    alt Automation Approval Required
        Agent->>Approver: Queue for Review (Planned Response, Confidence Score, Metadata)
        Approver->>Responder: Approve & Proceed
    end
    Responder->>Customer: Send Response (Accurate Product Info)
    Note over Agent,Responder: Log Steps, Ensure Isolation & Hallucination Prevention
    alt Errors (No Data, Low Confidence)
        Agent->>AiAssistant: Escalate with Priority
    end
